<title>BELGIUM: PetroFina says 1996 dividend up 14 pct.</title>
<headline>PetroFina says 1996 dividend up 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian oil group PetroFina said on Tuesday it would pay a gross dividend of 400 francs per share on its 1996 results, up 14 percent from the dividend paid on the 1995 figures.</p>
<p>It said the dividend, if approved by the annual general meeting on May 12, would be payable from May 28 on the 23,252,863 shares in circulation.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
